                  "content": "Puts tags on a client (and labels on photos, rules in customer groups). The chosen tags show as chips with a cross; \"Add tag\" opens a searchable list of the business's tags. Typing a name that doesn't exist offers to create it, when this person is allowed to. People who may only look see the chips without crosses. Today each tag gets a random colour, or grey in the App look.",
