              "content": "Four shared parts on 25 screens. The photo viewer opens when you tap a photo. The file picture shows any file small, a photo as a photo and a document as a sheet of paper. The photo box holds the one photo on a quote line or price list item. The upload list shows files going up in the File Manager. Approved by Jafar 2026-10-19: Photo viewer A with B's count and joined buttons, File picture B with A's check and failed boxes, Photo box A, Upload list B.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$font-family",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
