                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "gZJjX",
                          "name": "Desc",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Approved mix: a document is a small white sheet of paper with a folded corner and its type on a coloured tab. Tab colour tells the file family: documents blue (informative), spreadsheets green (success), videos purple (growth). Photos stay photos. From A: still being checked fills the whole box in the waiting colour and upload failed in the act-now colour, each with a big icon on a white tile and plain words.",
