              "width": 960,
              "content": "Five shared parts that sit inside a team note or a files card on jobs, quotes, requests, invoices, clients and the pipeline. Approved by Jafar 2026-10-19: Author line B, Note text B, Note files B, Files waiting to save B with A's failed box, Files card B, and the B note together.",
