                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 960,
                  "content": "A photo's caption and labels, written once on the photo so the same words show wherever it appears, including work reports. It sits in the file details panel under the photo, and in the small Describe photo pop-up from a record's files card. Save and Cancel show only once something changed. People who may see but not describe the photo get the words without boxes.",
