                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "iiFxs",
                  "name": "Desc",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 960,
                  "content": "Timers belong to the Time part of the app, so they take its indigo. Other people's timers show as an indigo clock capsule; Start and Stop are small white buttons with indigo icons; while your timer runs, the panel turns white with an indigo edge and the time is its big number; on today's visit row the indigo-edged clock joins straight onto Stop timer. Amber after 12 hours.",
