              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 960,
              "content": "The shape every record page shares — a client, request, quote, job, invoice or payment. A main column of cards, a 336 side column, the page tabs that split a record into groups, what an opening tab shows, and the save bar that appears when you edit something. Built from the approved Card, Card header, Tabs, page states and the New job save bar. Same behaviour as today: nothing new to press.",
