              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 1100,
              "content": "Client, request, quote, job, invoice and payment open with the same header part; only the data changes. Approved by Jafar 2026-10-20: option C (coloured top in the record's own colour). Added the same day: a 4px stripe along the very top in the status pill's colour, changing with the status; the client top uses the deeper taupe so it stands apart from the page. The top row holds only the record tile and its status pill beside the actions; under the client line, four facts per record follow what Jobber shows. No call / text / email buttons. Light and dark mode below.",
